  "details": "The new instance creation UI is messy and a bit confusing.\n\nSelected region is not shown on the button. Region selection could be a similar selector as Category as there is not many options. Region should be higher up and not an \"advanced option\".\n\nThe UI sets default description to the world description which makes little sense most of the time.\n\nVibe and category could be combined to one. I think these should be optional at the bottom. I just want to make an instance and now I have to scroll down to verify.\n\nSaving the settings is weird too since you cannot revert to the default where it chooses stuff based on the world.\n\nIn general the UI requires way too many clicks to operate and has an inconsistent design.",
